*label aly_night_retire
Alyndra ties the cords on her pack with deft, nimble fingers and rises from the table, flashing her wide, radiant smile one last time.

"First light, then. Rest well, partner—tomorrow we find out what the Empire left behind."

She slips gracefully through the common room toward the guest loft, leaving you with an empty trencher and the low hum of the tavern.

